<title>USA: Laguna Salada USD, Calif., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Laguna Salada USD, Calif., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter said it won $3.300 million of Laguna Salada USD, Calif., general obligation capital appreciation bonds, Election of 1997, Series 1997.</p>
</text>
